        "de": "Typen von Nebeln",
        "zh-TW": "星雲的種類",
        "pt-BR": "Tipos de nebulosas"
      },
      "summary": "별이 태어나고 죽는 우주의 가스 구름들 — 발광·반사·암흑·행성상·초신성 잔해.",
      "summaryI18n": {
        "en": "The cosmic gas clouds where stars are born and die — emission, reflection, dark, planetary, and supernova remnants.",
        "ja": "星が生まれ、死んでいく宇宙のガス雲 — 輝線星雲・反射星雲・暗黒星雲・惑星状星雲・超新星残骸。",
        "es": "Las nubes de gas cósmicas donde nacen y mueren las estrellas: de emisión, de reflexión, oscuras, planetarias y remanentes de supernova.",
        "de": "Die kosmischen Gaswolken, in denen Sterne geboren werden und sterben – Emissions-, Reflexions-, Dunkel-, planetarische Nebel und Supernova-Überreste.",
        "zh-TW": "恆星誕生與死亡的宇宙氣體雲——發射星雲、反射星雲、暗星雲、行星狀星雲與超新星殘骸。",
        "pt-BR": "As nuvens de gás cósmicas onde as estrelas nascem e morrem — de emissão, de reflexão, escuras, planetárias e remanescentes de supernova."
      },
      "scene": "scene-ism",
      "hostCard": false,
